The Tourist is a action, thriller, romance film
directed by Florian Henckel von Donnersmarck.

3
00:16:15,789 --> 00:16:21,789
American tourist Frank meets mysterious British
woman Elise on the train to Venice.

4
00:21:41,052 --> 00:21:47,052
Romance seems to bud, but there's more to her than meets the eye.

5
00:27:06,315 --> 00:27:12,315
Frank Tupelo, played by Johnny Depp.

6
00:32:31,578 --> 00:32:37,578
Elise Clifton-Ward, played by Angelina Jolie.

7
00:37:56,842 --> 00:38:02,842
Inspector John Acheson, played by Paul Bettany.

8
00:43:22,105 --> 00:43:28,105
Chief Inspector Jones, played by Timothy Dalton.

9
00:48:47,368 --> 00:48:53,368
Reginald Shaw, played by Steven Berkoff.

10
00:54:12,631 --> 00:54:18,631
The Englishman, played by Rufus Sewell.

11
00:59:37,894 --> 00:59:43,894
The Tourist is a 2010 American romantic thriller film co-written and directed by Florian Henckel von
Donnersmarck and starring Angelina Jolie, Johnny Depp, Paul Bettany, and Timothy Dalton.

12
01:05:03,157 --> 01:05:09,157
It is a remake of the 2005 French film Anthony Zimmer.

13
01:10:28,421 --> 01:10:34,421
GK Films financed and produced the film, with Sony Pictures Worldwide
Acquisitions releasing it in most countries through Columbia Pictures.

14
01:15:53,684 --> 01:15:59,684
The $100 million budget film went on to gross $278
million at the worldwide box office.

15
01:21:18,947 --> 01:21:24,947
Despite negative reception from the critics, the film was nominated for three Golden Globes,
with a debate arising over the question as to whether it was a comedy or a drama.

16
01:26:44,210 --> 01:26:50,210
Henckel von Donnersmarck repeatedly stated it was neither genre, calling it "a travel romance with
thriller elements," but that if he had to choose between the two, he would choose comedy.

17
01:32:09,473 --> 01:32:15,473
The film explores themes of hotel, paris, france,
undercover agent, venice, italy, fake identity.

18
01:37:34,736 --> 01:37:40,736
The tone is emotional and intense.
